      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_01",
      "hash64": "4DD04D4773929EBA",
      "text": "Hallo! Wie kann ich dir behilflich sein?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_select_01",
      "hash64": "B1EB6702BB84D9F7",
      "text": "Ich will an der Blaubeer-Liga teilnehmen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_select_02",
      "hash64": "B1EB6802BB84DBAA",
      "text": "Ach, schon gut...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_02",
      "hash64": "4DD04C4773929D07",
      "text": "Bitte entschuldige, aber du scheinst zum\\nAustausch hier zu sein.\\c\\nDas bedeutet leider, dass du [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1010,0000)]kein offiziellerkeine offizielle\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0907,0000)]SchülerSchülerin der Blaubeer-Akademie bist...",
